# Claude Code: the WORKFLOW files (commands, agents, hooks, skills,
# settings.json) are tracked as of 2026-09-05 (docs/workflows/DESIGN.md D1).
# Only the local settings (which may carry credentials from allowed commands,
# the v0.2.6 leak) and per-session state stay out. The sdist still excludes
# ALL of .claude/ (pyproject [tool.hatch.build.targets.sdist]), asserted by
# tests/test_build.py and tests/test_sdist_exclusions.py.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.bak
.claude/state/

